PARITY (web ChargingSessionCard.tsx -> native), no scope narrowing
==================================================================================
  - getChargerCategory  -> ChargerKind.category(forType:)  (super/tpc, dc/ccs/chademo/fast,
                           home/ac/wall, nil/empty=home, else unknown) — all branches tested.
  - durationMinutes / avgPowerW (energy-over-time, avg_power_w fallback) / costPerKwh /
    distanceAddedM / inline sessionScore — ported verbatim, SI Wh/W/m respected.
  - A–F grade via scoreScale DEFAULT_SCORE_THRESHOLDS (90/80/65/50/35/0); GRADE_PALETTE hexes
    mapped to theme-aware tokens (emerald->success, cyan->info, amber->warning, red->danger,
    dark-red->critical, grey->neutral) — never a hardcoded hex.
  - Composition = HistoryListRow: checkbox (onToggleSelect) + leading ScoreBadge (only when
    score!=null, aria override) + primary (TimeStamp · duration + charger/energy/free/anomaly
    badges) + RouteDisplay single endpoint + metrics (BatteryDelta + peak/avg/duration/cost/
    cpk/distanceGained), density=compact hides metrics, glow = supercharger?cyan:green.
  - All 7 web i18n keys reproduced in the catalog: chargerTypes.{supercharger,dc,home,unknown},
    selectSession, free, scoreAria ("Battery-friendly score: {{value}}"). Reproduced shared
    components (BatteryDelta/RouteDisplay) + metric templates + native chrome keys included.
  - States: loading (skeleton), loaded (card), empty (friendly), error (QueryError+retry),
    stale (chip+refresh), offline (cached+chip) — all rendered, never a blank box.
  - A11y: row = one labelled button (rowSummary) + hint; ScoreBadge aria override; BatteryDelta
    from->to label; Checkbox labelled + .isSelected; decorative icons accessibilityHidden.
  - Telemetry: ChargingSessionCardSurface.slug="ChargingSessionCard" emitted via P1/S11
    view.opened on appear (idempotent), os_log default sink, redaction-safe.

